ss=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A/Q,I_Q)\">\\((A/Q,I_Q)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a]_Q\">\\([a]_Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_Q\">\\(q_Q\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"050e3997281664f2\" href=\"?note=050e3997281664f2\" title=\"56-df-quotient-algebra\">56-df-quotient-algebra</a>，同态取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f75e1125f61f318\" href=\"?note=4f75e1125f61f318\" title=\"56-df-sigma-homomorphism\">56-df-sigma-homomorphism</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\}\\;[a_i]_Q=[b_i]_Q)\n\\Longrightarrow[I(f)(\\vec a)]_Q=[I(f)(\\vec b)]_Q\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\}\\;[a_i]_Q=[b_i]_Q)\n\\Longrightarrow[I(f)(\\vec a)]_Q=[I(f)(\\vec b)]_Q\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A/Q,I_Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A/Q,I_Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,A/Q,I_Q,q_Q)\\land q_Q[A]=A/Q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,A/Q,I_Q,q_Q)\\land q_Q[A]=A/Q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已读原书 Lemma 7.1.10 的证明：代表类相同给出各分量Q相关，再用运算相容性得到输出类相同；每个输入类元组可逐一取代表，故商运算是全函数。自然投影保持运算由定义直接成立，且每个类是某个a的像。最后的投影结论是同一构造的本地推论。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.9–7.1.10，印刷页 263。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"050e3997281664f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-quotient-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sigma-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4f75e1125f61f318","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"050e3997281664f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$、$\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)$。$(A/Q,I_Q)$、$[a]_Q$、$q_Q$ 取 [[56-df-quotient-algebra]]，同态取 [[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]；$\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sigma-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4f75e1125f61f318","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$、$\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)$。$(A/Q,I_Q)$、$[a]_Q$、$q_Q$ 取 [[56-df-quotient-algebra]]，同态取 [[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]；$\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":